[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245913540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245913540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245913540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeLXE","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T15:53:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T15:55:34Z","body":"This would not be possible to allow as it would require editing permissions, instead this should be a matter of commenting on it to clarify this\n\nThere's no way to unlink PRs otherwise without editing permissions for other people's comments, which we obviously cannot grant, GitHub does not allow unlinking PRs manually if they are referenced using keywords like \"closes\" unfortunately\n\nFor the specific unintended part we do try to avoid people linking issues in commits, but it's not enforced entirely","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245913540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245931713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245931713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245931713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BePzB","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T15:59:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T15:59:02Z","body":"> For the specific unintended part we do try to avoid people linking issues in commits, but it's not enforced entirely\n\nI'm actually fine with the way it is then.  I'd rather putting in PRs be an easier process than not.  Getting in fixes and feature is far more important (imo) than unintended issues getting closed.  Those can easily be reopened as we just did.\n\n> There's no way to unlink PRs otherwise without editing permissions for other people's comments, which we obviously cannot grant, GitHub does not allow unlinking PRs manually if they are referenced using keywords like \"closes\" unfortunately\n\nThat's annoying that the 2 permissions are intertwined.  It sounds like this is something simply out of our control.\n\nI think we can probably close this issue then unless anyone else has anything to add :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245931713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245932364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245932364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245932364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeP9M","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T15:59:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T15:59:15Z","body":"> There's no way to unlink PRs otherwise without editing permissions for other people's comments, which we obviously cannot grant, GitHub does not allow unlinking PRs manually if they are referenced using keywords like \"closes\" unfortunately\n\nFrom the issue you can unlink PRs under the development tab on the right side of the issue!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245932364/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245937115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245937115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245937115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeRHb","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:00:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:00:49Z","body":"How? I cannot when checking other cases, so that is not universally possible at least not for me","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245937115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245944409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245944409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245944409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeS5Z","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:03:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:03:09Z","body":"> From the issue you can unlink PRs under the development tab on the right side of the issue!\n\nI can test it next time I put in a PR, but I'm pretty sure the issue is **I** cannot do this.  GitHub picks up that I mentioned an issue in the PR description and auto links it to closing an issue. But I myself cannot unlink it.  Someone with higher permissions has to do that.\n\nWhich gets annoying when I say something like:\n\n\"This PR solves part of this issue (issue link) but not the whole thing.  Another PR will be incoming for the other part.  And here is x, y, ad z reason why I'm submitting them as separate PRs.\"\n\nMost common reason being the first PR is a hotfix that fixes the most glaring part.  But to fix the entire thing is more complex.\n\nBut as @AThousandShips points out, you @clayjohn then have to unlink that issue for us as we don't have those permissions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245944409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245948403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245948403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245948403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeT3z","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:04:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:04:26Z","body":"And also as @AThousandShips pointed out, this is the reason we don't have those permissions as normal contributors:\n\n> There's no way to unlink PRs otherwise without editing permissions for other people's comments, which we obviously cannot grant, GitHub does not allow unlinking PRs manually if they are referenced using keywords like \"closes\" unfortunately","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245948403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245948637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245948637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245948637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeT7d","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:04:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:04:31Z","body":"Unless it's specific ownership permissions I should have the same permissions, so it might be specific PR cases and not all\n\nBut in the end it's not worse than having to reopen the issue if it's closed incorrectly ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245948637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245954085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245954085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245954085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeVQl","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:05:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:05:56Z","body":"> How? I cannot when checking other cases, so that is not universally possible at least not for me\n\nYou click on the little gear beside \"development\" on the issue (not the PR, in the PR the only option is to edit the original comment)\n\nHere is an example from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110143\n\nHere is what the development tab looks like\n<img width=\"359\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51ed9244-b001-4369-935f-17424695c408\" />\n\nIf you click the gear you can see the linked PRs and then unlink them or add new links as desired\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"464\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26e560f6-e22a-4d42-b141-952b1c658b75\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245954085/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245956391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3245956391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3245956391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BeV0n","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u