ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:25:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T16:25:08Z","body":"Ah now I know why I couldn't do it on one issue, it doesn't work across repos, regardless of ownership, so it works with the sidebar for where the issue and PR are on the same repo, assuming permissions","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3246017084/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247965131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3247965131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3247965131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BmAPL","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T07:08:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T07:08:14Z","body":"> Mention an issue in the description\n\nIn this case, it was closed because there was `closes #x` in the commit message as well, so editing PR description or unlinking PR wouldn't do anything. If it was only in the description, it would be easily editable by anyone with write permissions (and seems like was done before merging). Mentions in the comments should not trigger any actions.\n\n<img width=\"427\" height=\"145\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f981ae9b-7fdb-4d43-a5b0-fe5d887f990a\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247965131/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251776996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110199#issuecomment-3251776996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110199","id":3251776996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B0i3k","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T04:21:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T04:21:21Z","body":"I can confirm that I cannot unlink PRs that I author even if I am the author of both the PR and the issue:\n\n<img width=\"1470\" height=\"977\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/657f3f95-b233-4155-bb97-b78fd325b535\" />\n\nIssue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109846\nPR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110244\n\nAlso to note, my issue does not inform me of any PRs that are currently open that will close this issue upon completion.  At least not that I can tell in the screenshot above.  Maybe editing out the \"fixed <issue link>\" will prevent it from occuring, but I don't have any way of knowing personally until it goes through.\n\nAs suggested above, I believe this is likely a feature request that would need to be elevated to GitHub themselves.  At the very least, this is an exceptionally helpful thread that I will link maintainers from other repos to when they ask us ~~peasants~~ contributors to unlink issues from our PRs.  I think we've narrowed down that we simply can't :)\n\nI'm fine with closing this issue if you all are :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251776996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]